  "description": "The RogueHawk FS 2 is built for riders who crave serious power and performance. At its heart is a 2000W+ peak-rated rear hub motor, delivering massive torque and explosive acceleration that tears up trails and dominates pavement. Paired with a high-voltage 70V 20Ah (1400Wh) battery, this setup unleashes relentless off-the-line speed and sustained performance that puts other eBikes to shame.\nNeed more juice? The RogueHawk FS 2 is dual-battery ready, letting you extend your range and ride harder for longer. A precision torque sensor ensures smooth, responsive pedal assist, while the beefy full suspension frame keeps you planted and comfortable at any speed. This is a machine for riders who know what they want, and refuse to settle.\nKey Features:\n\n2000W+ peak rear hub motor – Unmatched power for aggressive off-road and high-speed use\n\n70V 20Ah (1400Wh) battery – High-capacity, high-voltage power system\n\nDual battery ready – Add a second battery for extreme range and extended performance\n\nAdvanced torque sensor – Natural pedal feel with high precision response\n\nStep-Over or Step-Thru Frame Options – Choose between a rugged performance step-over or an easy-access step-thru frame, both built to handle the power of a 2000W high-performance electric bike.\n\nBeefy full suspension frame – Built to handle real-world punishment with comfort and control",
